/E (A custom Python script was developed using Pandas and OpenPyXL to perform systematic data cleaning, transformation and exportation of the Aster Retail Holdings \(London\) dataset. The script ensured that the data was consistent, accurate and analysis-ready for Power BI \(Visualisation\) use.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [1]
>>
